  "operative_text": "Section 1 (Section 23-31-240): \"Notwithstanding any other provision contained in this article, the following persons who possess a valid permit pursuant to this article may carry a concealable weapon anywhere within this State: ... (13) the Attorney General and assistant attorneys general; and (14) active clerks of court.\""
